        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Invert a Still\n\nTurns an image into its negative by flipping every color channel. Use it to check that a filter chain is changing the pixels you expect.\n\n**How it works:** The \"Image\" input passes your picture to \"Invert\", which replaces each channel value with its opposite. \"Result\" shows the negative. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Drop in a photo with strong colors and compare the output. Then chain a second \"Invert\" after the first and confirm you get the original back."
        },
